---
title: Org Withdrawal Request State Machine
---

stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> REQUEST_DRAFT: operator opens withdrawal or membership request

  REQUEST_DRAFT --> REQUEST_SUBMITTED: request submitted for operator handling
  REQUEST_DRAFT --> CANCELLED: requester abandons draft

  REQUEST_SUBMITTED --> REVIEW_PENDING: another operator must review
  REQUEST_SUBMITTED --> CANCELLED: requester cancels before review
  REQUEST_SUBMITTED --> FAILED: request cannot continue

  REVIEW_PENDING --> STEP_UP_REQUIRED: reviewer must complete MFA step-up
  REVIEW_PENDING --> REJECTED: reviewer rejects request
  REVIEW_PENDING --> FAILED: review cannot continue

  STEP_UP_REQUIRED --> APPROVED: reviewer passes MFA and approves
  STEP_UP_REQUIRED --> REJECTED: step-up fails or approval denied
  STEP_UP_REQUIRED --> FAILED: approval cannot continue

  APPROVED --> EXECUTED: operator withdrawal or membership change executed
  APPROVED --> FAILED: execution failed

  note right of REQUEST_DRAFT
    Org withdrawal remains a request workflow.
    It is not the app/com account withdrawal
    lifecycle diagram.
  end note

  EXECUTED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
